# Canonical identities for `git shortlog -sne` and `git log`.
#
# The subject grades "commits from all team members" and "proper work
# distribution". One human committing from two machines under two addresses
# shows up as two contributors and halves their apparent share, so map every
# alias here — and set a consistent identity on each machine you commit from:
#
#   git config user.name "<42 login>"
#   git config user.email "<the address you want on record>"
#
# Format:  Canonical Name <canonical@email>  <alias@email>

amkhelif <amkhelif@f1br8s1.paris.42.school> <amkhelif@f1br8s1.paris.42.school>
amkhelif <amkhelif@f1br8s1.paris.42.school> <khelif_a@etna-alternance.net>

